OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FChance of a
OL,6,Flittle light rain for a time this
OL,7,Fevening. Otherwise variable amounts of
OL,8,Fcloud overnight with the odd shower,
OL,9,Fthese mainly across the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA mainly dry and cloudy
OL,12,Fmorning. Some showery rain is likely
OL,13,Fto spread east through the afternoon
OL,14,Fwith patchy rain continuing into the
OL,15,Fevening.
