OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fdrier later. Bright spells and a few
OL,8,Fshowers on Thursday and Friday, but
OL,9,Fsome longer spells of rain possible
OL,10,Flater Thursday.
